{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A little game about exploring a desert and restoring its water flow... Among other things!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768120/extras/Desert_GIF_Sands_of_Hope.gif?t=1749110026\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Discover this open world and uncover the secrets of Cydonia's Village. Collect Energy Cores with the help of a loyal companion to restore water to the desert and meet villagers along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">KEY FEATURES</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Small and hand-crafted open world, full of secrets, collectibles and activities. Follow the trail or just get lost and create your own path... it's all in your hands!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Using an innovative ability, Hope can pick up, move, rotate and even attach magnetic cubes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find the Energy Cores and bring them to the AI to help her keep the balance of this land</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chat with the villagers of Cydonia. You might be able to help each other out! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy the unique and nostalgic 3D-Pixel Art graphics style</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768120/extras/Shrine_GIF_Sands_of_Hope.gif?t=1749110026\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">ABOUT THIS DEMO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This demo offers a sneak peek into the opening moments of the full game, giving players a chance to explore the hand-crafted world, meet some villagers, and play around with Hope's magnetic abilities!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768120?t=1749110026","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam